{"id":"S36-one-authoritative-squad-post-per-batch","title":"a batch of three squad-state messages produces ONE status post, not four","sections":["S36","S31"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"ed0a50b","date":"2026-06-12","note":"RC1 of the Sutton Lads incident: four contradictory squad posts about one second apart from a single analyzer batch. All squad-STATE replies in a batch now collapse into ONE deterministic post composed from a FRESH DB snapshot taken AFTER every attendance write in the batch."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"}]},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (10/14):*\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Sait Demir\n4. Mustafa Kaya\n5. Abid Hussain\n6. Idris Bello\n7. Faris Nasser\n8. Shaz Iqbal\n9. Adam Osman\n10. Efat Rahman\n\nWe need *4 more*. Reply *IN* to grab a spot."}],"messages":[{"from":"usama","body":"in","stub":{"intent":"in","registerAttendance":"IN","confidence":0.95,"react":"👍","reasoning":"plain self IN"}},{"from":"karahan","body":"in","stub":{"intent":"in","registerAttendance":"IN","confidence":0.95,"react":"👍","reasoning":"plain self IN"}},{"from":"zair","tag":true,"body":"@Match Time how many are we now?","stub":{"intent":"question","registerAttendance":null,"confidence":0.9,"reply":"We're 12/14 ✅ — need 2 more.","reasoning":"squad-state question"}}],"expect":{"counts":{"confirmed":12},"speaksAtMost":1},"tags":["batch","collapse"],"stubKind":"corrected","contractTagAdded":true,"notes":"FIDELITY CAVEAT: the production message was UNTAGGED. It carries an @Match Time tag here because the interaction contract (19f43e3, 2026-06-18, narrowed by bd3305d) landed AFTER this incident and now requires a tag for every directed op, so the untagged original can no longer reach the behaviour this case exists to pin. See the 2026-09-01 note in MDs/analyzer-redesign-2026-08-31.md section 3.2."}
{"id":"S34-format-switch-benches-nobody-at-8","title":"with 8 confirmed, a 5-a-side switch benches NOBODY and names no one","sections":["S34"],"category":"D","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"aabc760","date":"2026-08-30","player":"Najib Ahmadi, Mojib Sadat, Mustafa Kaya","note":"Posted to a real customer group with eight confirmed: 'we could switch to 5-a-side (10 players) — Najib + Mojib + Mustafa go on the bench'. The model subtracted players-per-TEAM (8-5=3) instead of the format TOTAL (8-10), then picked three real people to tell they were losing their place. 8 does not fill 10, so the switch was never on the table at all."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"najib","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mojib","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"}]},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (8/1